<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of May 26.</p>
<p>				    May 26/May 23   May 26/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.07		 6.84</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.07		 4.92</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.04		 9.38</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.02		61.25</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    1.05		32.44</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  1.10		33.17</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.08		 9.98</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.20		25.36</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    1.13		39.72</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  1.19		38.22</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.17		17.85</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.22		97.82</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,313,898,430,178</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,913,886,023,153</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,064,681,176,214</p>
<p>  International funds			    92,648,444,749</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    242,682,786,063</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
